</span></span><span id="S5.T3.1.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_text"></span></th>
<th id="S5.T3.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_t"><span id="S5.T3.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text"></span> <span id="S5.T3.1.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_text">
